    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The calibration logs look clean and the secondary sensor doesn't show the same spikes, so it's definitely an issue with the primary AUV unit. It's really frustrating because the data is so erratic; it feels like there's some kind of intermittent fault in the signal processing board or maybe a loose connection in the housing. Do you have any thoughts on why a sensor would start exhibiting such sudden, erratic behavior like this out of nowhere?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
